# Y3Heavy, rear rotor at 10% of the weight (the defaults), first hover
# on the real vehicle: rate gains at 60% of copter-y3heavy.parm, softer
# angle loop and shaping, MOT_TRI_RHOV starting low and learned in
# ALT_HOLD or LOITER. Raise to 80% and 100% after checking the logs
MOT_TRI_RHOV    0.15
MOT_TRI_RH_LEARN 2
ATC_RAT_RLL_P   0.085
ATC_RAT_RLL_I   0.085
ATC_RAT_RLL_D   0.0034
ATC_RAT_PIT_P   0.331
ATC_RAT_PIT_I   0.331
ATC_RAT_PIT_D   0.0091
ATC_RAT_YAW_P   0.474
ATC_RAT_YAW_I   0.047
ATC_RAT_YAW_D   0
ATC_ANG_RLL_P   4.5
ATC_ANG_PIT_P   6
ATC_ANG_YAW_P   3
ATC_ACC_R_MAX   400
ATC_ACC_P_MAX   150
ATC_ACC_Y_MAX   150
